<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts some airline stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts some airline stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded some airline stocks.</p>
<p>-- Removed AMR Corp from the recommended list and now rates the stock as market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Removed Delta Air Lines Inc from the priority list, but said Delta was &quot;still on the recommended list.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Cut UAL Corp to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
